[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:9. A Cold Welcome]
[00:00.580] Passage 9 | 文章九
[00:02.120] A cold welcome | 冷遇
[00:05.140] On Wednesday evening, | 星期三晚上，
[00:07.875] we went to the town hall. | 我们去了市政厅。
[00:10.385] It was the last day of the year, | 那是那一年中的最后一天，
[00:13.045] and a large crowd of people | 一大群人
[00:15.065] had gathered under the town hall clock. | 聚集在市政厅钟楼下。
[00:18.280] It would strike 12 in 20 minutes' time.| 20分钟后钟声将敲响12点。
[00:23.450] 15 minutes passed, | 15分钟过去了，
[00:26.545] and then at 5 to 12, | 然后在11点55分时，
[00:28.650] the clock stopped. | 钟停了。
[00:31.070] The big minute hand did not move.| 那根大分针一动不动。
[00:34.865] We waited and waited, | 我们等啊等，
[00:37.255] but nothing happened. | 但什么也没发生。
[00:39.075] Suddenly, | 突然，
[00:41.130] someone shouted, | 有人喊道，
[00:42.440] "It's two minutes past 12!" | “已经12点过两分了！”
[00:45.615] "The clock has stopped!" | “钟停了！”
[00:48.230] I looked at my watch. | 我看了看我的手表。
[00:50.160] It was true. | 的确如此。
[00:52.070] The big clock | 那座大钟
[00:53.55] refused to welcome the New Year. | 拒绝迎接新年。
[00:56.680] At that moment, | 就在那一刻，
[00:58.580] everybody began to laugh and sing. | 每个人都开始欢笑和歌唱。